---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Zero to one marketing — AgenticPath"
  description="Marketing with agentic systems for B2B companies with complex, high-value sales."
>
  <main>
    <div class="band band-hero">
      <section class="band-inner hero">
        <img class="hero-lockup lockup-light" src="wordmark-stacked.png" alt="AgenticPath" />
        <img class="hero-lockup lockup-dark" src="wordmark-mono-paper-on-ink.png" alt="AgenticPath" />
        <p class="tagline">Zero to one marketing.</p>
        <h1>Marketing for B2B companies with complex, high-value sales.</h1>
        <p class="lede">AgenticPath helps B2B companies with long sales cycles and high-value deals improve marketing and the marketing-to-sales system.</p>
        <p class="kicker">Two months. One audit, one strategy.</p>
        <p><a class="cta" href="#contact">Get in touch</a> <a class="cta cta-ghost" href="#how">See how we work</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="band" id="engagement" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="band-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">The engagement</p>
        <h2>Two months. Then you decide.</h2>
        <svg class="journey" viewBox="0 0 760 240" role="img" aria-label="A route with three stops: month one audit, month two strategy, then optional execution, ending in a teal square full stop. A teal point travels along the route through the three stops.">
          <line class="route" x1="40" y1="70" x2="680" y2="70" />
          <g>
            <circle class="node" cx="140" cy="70" r="20" />
            <text class="node-num" x="140" y="75" text-anchor="middle">01</text>
            <text class="stop-label" x="140" y="130" text-anchor="middle">Audit</text>
            <text class="stop-detail" x="140" y="156" text-anchor="middle">Month one</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <circle class="node" cx="380" cy="70" r="20" />
            <text class="node-num" x="380" y="75" text-anchor="middle">02</text>
            <text class="stop-label" x="380" y="130" text-anchor="middle">Strategy</text>
            <text class="stop-detail" x="380" y="156" text-anchor="middle">Month two</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <circle class="node" cx="620" cy="70" r="20" />
            <text class="node-num" x="620" y="75" text-anchor="middle">03</text>
            <text class="stop-label" x="620" y="130" text-anchor="middle">Execution</text>
            <text class="stop-detail" x="620" y="156" text-anchor="middle">Optional</text>
          </g>
          <circle class="traveller" r="7" cx="0" cy="0">
            <animateMotion dur="6s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M40,70 L680,70" />
          </circle>
          <rect class="full-stop" x="688" y="55" width="30" height="30" />
        </svg>
        <p class="muted">One month to understand how you win customers today. One month to turn that into a tailored strategy and go-to-market plan. Execution after that is your call, not ours to assume.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="band band-dark" id="problem" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="band-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p>
        <h2>Long cycles. High stakes. Marketing that does not keep up.</h2>
        <div class="problems">
          <div>
            <span class="num">01</span>
            <h3>Foundations</h3>
            <p class="muted">Positioning, website and target customers that were never properly established.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="num">02</span>
            <h3>Measurement</h3>
            <p class="muted">No clear picture of what marketing does, or what it should be measured on.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="num">03</span>
            <h3>Demand</h3>
            <p class="muted">Demand generation that does not match a sales cycle measured in months.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="num">04</span>
            <h3>The handoff</h3>
            <p class="muted">Marketing and sales not connected, so opportunities stall between them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="band" id="how" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="band-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
        <h2>Human-led. Agentic where it repeats.</h2>
        <div class="process">
          <article>
            <span class="num">01</span>
            <h3>Month one, audit</h3>
            <p>We build a grounded picture of how you win and serve customers today: positioning, channels, the sales path, the data you have, and where opportunities stall.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="num">02</span>
            <h3>Month two, strategy</h3>
            <p>The audit findings become a tailored strategy and go-to-market plan, sequenced, with the measurement to match.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span class="num">03</span>
            <h3>Then, execution</h3>
            <p>Optional. Paid media, organic search and content, social activity, analytics, and RevOps, with agentic systems supporting the repeatable work over time.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="band band-close">
      <section class="band-inner-narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">Where we are</p>
        <h2>We are winning our first customers before scaling the product.</h2>
        <p>This site is a scaffold, not a catalogue of services. The work starts with a conversation, not a package.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="band" id="contact" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="band-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Talk to us</p>
        <h2>Tell us what marketing should do.</h2>
        <p class="lede">A short note is enough. We read every message and reply ourselves.</p>
        <iframe
          class="contact-form"
          src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd6_JaUBZmlDsEuRnHvLHHnYs9AA9WSED-D__tYVtDPusqkgg/viewform?embedded=true"
          title="AgenticPath get in touch form"
          loading="lazy"
        >Loading the form…</iframe>
        <p class="muted">Prefer the form on its own page? <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd6_JaUBZmlDsEuRnHvLHHnYs9AA9WSED-D__tYVtDPusqkgg/viewform">Open it here</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
